%% Sequence: read alumni list
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as Browser
    participant F as frontend (Vite)
    participant A as alumni-api
    participant M as MongoDB

    U->>F: load page
    F->>A: GET /api/v1/alumni
    A->>M: collection.find({})
    M-->>A: cursor of docs
    A-->>F: 200 JSON [Alumni]
    F-->>U: rendered list
